Bit-By-Bit Academy  ·  Data Governance Audit Report

**Bit-By-Bit Academy**

**Data Governance and Data Flow Audit**

Findings Report and Action Plan

Completed by

**Rhoda Report**

Director of Technology

2026-05-20

**Executive Summary**

| **Assessment Scope**  -  all 5 registered systems were audited. **For each system, this audit reviewed: **data access controls and user permissions; data retention and deletion practices; vendor data-sharing and contractual protections; backup coverage and recovery readiness; breach notification and incident response procedures. **Systems audited in this session:** **  + Veracross (SIS)**  (data held: Student academic records (grades, transcripts, reports), Student behavioral records (discipline, incidents), Student health records (medical, counseling, nurse), Parent and family contact data, Admissions and enrollment data, Staff HR records (employment, performance)) **  + Google Workspace for Education Plus**  (data held: Student academic records (grades, transcripts, reports), Parent and family contact data, Communications (email, messages, chat), Intellectual property (curriculum, assessments), Authentication credentials (usernames, passwords, tokens), Security and audit logs) **  + Seesaw**  (data held: Student academic records (grades, transcripts, reports), Parent and family contact data) **  + Lightspeed Filter**  (data held: Security and audit logs, Student academic records (grades, transcripts, reports)) **  + Bark for Schools**  (data held: Student behavioral records (discipline, incidents), Communications (email, messages, chat)) *All registered systems were audited - no gaps in coverage.* |
| --- |

| **Overall Grade: ****F**   ·   5 systems audited **4 critical  ****6 high  ** Systems by severity: 2 urgent  ·  3 watch **⚠  **Systems rated CONCERN or URGENT hold staff HR records, student behavioral records and student health records. These categories carry the highest regulatory and reputational risk. |
| --- |

