**Veracross (SIS)**

Grade: **F**   Score: 29% (32/110 pts)   Status: **URGENT**

Data held: *student academic records, student behavioral records, student health records, parent contact data, admissions data and staff HR records*

| **Area** | **Score** | **Bar** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Access Control | **44%** | ████░░░░░░ |
| Backup & Recovery | **29%** | ███░░░░░░░ |
| Data Flows | **50%** | █████░░░░░ |
| Vendor & Contract | **0%** | ░░░░░░░░░░ |
| Retention & Disposal | **0%** | ░░░░░░░░░░ |

**[CRITICAL]  ****No Data Processing Agreement on file**  ·  Vendor & Contract

No contract or Data Processing Agreement (DPA) exists for Veracross (SIS). Without a DPA, the school has no contractual protection for its data. This system holds student academic records, student behavioral records, student health records, parent contact data, admissions data and staff HR records.

| **Action: **Request a DPA from the vendor immediately. If the vendor will not provide one, assess whether continued use is appropriate. *Owner: Business Office  **  ·  Do within 30 days**  ·  Substantial (5 days)* |
| --- |

**[HIGH]  ****Some data transfers not encrypted**  ·  Data Flows

Some outbound connections from Veracross (SIS) are not encrypted. Review and remediate all unencrypted paths. This system holds student academic records, student behavioral records, student health records, parent contact data, admissions data and staff HR records.

| **Action: **Identify which specific transfers are unencrypted and resolve each one. Document when all transfers have been secured. *Owner: IT Director  **  ·  Do within 30 days**  ·  Medium (3 days)* |
| --- |

**[MEDIUM]  ****MFA available but not required**  ·  Access Control

MFA is available in Veracross (SIS) but is not mandatory. Optional MFA is routinely not enabled by users, leaving accounts protected only by passwords. This system holds student academic records, student behavioral records, student health records, parent contact data, admissions data and staff HR records.

| **Action: **Enable mandatory MFA for all accounts in this system. Set a deadline and enforce it. *Owner: IT Director  **  ·  Do within 90 days**  ·  Quick (½ day)* |
| --- |

**[MEDIUM]  ****No data deletion process — data accumulates indefinitely**  ·  Retention & Disposal

Veracross (SIS) has no process to delete data at the end of its retention period. Data accumulating indefinitely increases legal liability and makes it harder to respond to data requests or incidents. This system holds student academic records, student behavioral records, student health records, parent contact data, admissions data and staff HR records.

| **Action: **Define and document a deletion schedule for each data category held in this system. Confirm the schedule with the Business Office and assign a named owner responsible for annual execution. *Owner: IT Director  **  ·  Do within 90 days**  ·  Medium (3 days)* |
| --- |

**[LOW]  ****Audit logs not being reviewed**  ·  Access Control

Veracross (SIS) maintains audit logs, but they are not reviewed regularly (or the retention period is unknown). Logs that are never reviewed provide no early warning of unauthorised access or misuse. This system holds student academic records, student behavioral records, student health records, parent contact data, admissions data and staff HR records.

| **Action: **Establish a monthly log review — even a 15-minute check for unusual login times or bulk exports adds real value. Confirm the retention period with the vendor and document it. Assign a named owner responsible for the monthly review. *Owner: IT Director  **  ·  Schedule this year**  ·  Quick (½ day)* |
| --- |

**[LOW]  ****Vendor security practices not reviewed**  ·  Vendor & Contract

The school has not reviewed the security practices of the vendor for Veracross (SIS). A SOC 2 Type II report is the standard way to verify a cloud vendor's security controls — many provide it on request. This system holds student academic records, student behavioral records, student health records, parent contact data, admissions data and staff HR records.

| **Action: **Request a SOC 2 Type II report or the vendor's published security documentation. Review it and file a copy with the contract records. *Owner: IT Director  **  ·  Schedule this year**  ·  Quick (½ day)* |
| --- |

**Google Workspace for Education Plus**

Grade: **C**   Score: 68% (75/110 pts)   Status: **WATCH**

Data held: *student academic records, parent contact data, communications data, curriculum/IP, authentication credentials and security logs*

| **Area** | **Score** | **Bar** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Access Control | **58%** | ██████░░░░ |
| Backup & Recovery | **67%** | ███████░░░ |
| Data Flows | **100%** | ██████████ |
| Vendor & Contract | **80%** | ████████░░ |
| Retention & Disposal | **60%** | ██████░░░░ |

**[CRITICAL]  ****Former staff accounts still active**  ·  Access Control

One or more accounts belonging to staff who have left the school were found active in Google Workspace for Education Plus. Active former-staff accounts are a direct security risk — an open door for people no longer authorised to access school data. This system holds student academic records, parent contact data, communications data, curriculum/IP, authentication credentials and security logs.

| **Action: **Immediately revoke all identified former-staff accounts. Review the offboarding checklist to add this system explicitly. Assign a named owner responsible for running this check at every departure. *Owner: IT Director  **  ·  Do within 30 days**  ·  Quick (½ day)* |
| --- |

**[HIGH]  ****Backup never tested**  ·  Backup & Recovery

The backup for Google Workspace for Education Plus has never been tested. A backup that has never been restored is an assumption, not a safety net. This system holds student academic records, parent contact data, communications data, curriculum/IP, authentication credentials and security logs.

| **Action: **Schedule and perform a restore test for this system. Document the test date, what was restored, and who verified it. *Owner: IT Director  **  ·  Do within 30 days**  ·  Quick (½ day)* |
| --- |

**[MEDIUM]  ****MFA available but not required**  ·  Access Control

MFA is available in Google Workspace for Education Plus but is not mandatory. Optional MFA is routinely not enabled by users, leaving accounts protected only by passwords. This system holds student academic records, parent contact data, communications data, curriculum/IP, authentication credentials and security logs.

| **Action: **Enable mandatory MFA for all accounts in this system. Set a deadline and enforce it. *Owner: IT Director  **  ·  Do within 90 days**  ·  Quick (½ day)* |
| --- |

**[LOW]  ****Data deletion not documented**  ·  Retention & Disposal

Google Workspace for Education Plus deletes data at the end of its retention period, but the process is not documented. An undocumented deletion process cannot be audited or verified.

| **Action: **Document the deletion process: who initiates it, when, what confirmation is received, and where the record is kept. Add this to the annual IT calendar. *Owner: IT Director  **  ·  Schedule this year**  ·  Quick (½ day)* |
| --- |

